{"speciesId":534,"names":{"fr":"Bétochef","es":"Conkeldurr","en":"Conkeldurr","ja":"ローブシン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On pense que la recette du ciment a été enseignée aux humains par un Bétochef il y a 2 000 ans."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is thought that Conkeldurr taught humans how to make concrete more than 2,000 years ago."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut manier sans effort apparent les piliers de béton dont il se sert comme de cannes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They use concrete pillars as walking canes. They know moves that enable them to swing the pillars freely in battle."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On pense que la recette du ciment a été enseignée aux humains par un Bétochef il y a 2 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se cree que Conkeldurr enseñó a los humanos la técnica para elaborar cemento hace más de 2000 años."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is thought that Conkeldurr taught humans how to make concrete more than 2,000 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"コンクリートを 作る 技術は ２０００年前に ローブシンから 教わったと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il utilise l’effet centrifuge pour manier sans trop d’effort ses piliers de béton et déclencher des attaques puissantes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"En vez de hacer uso de la fuerza bruta, blande columnas de hormigón con la energía centrífuga de sus movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"力に 頼らず 遠心力を うまく 活かして コンクリートを 振り回す 技を 使いこなせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On pense que la recette du ciment a été enseignée aux humains par un Bétochef il y a 2 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se cree que Conkeldurr enseñó a los humanos la técnica para elaborar cemento hace más de 2000 años."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It is thought that Conkeldurr taught humans how to make concrete more than 2,000 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"コンクリートを 作る 技術は ２０００年前に ローブシンから 教わったと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il utilise l’effet centrifuge pour manier sans trop d’effort ses piliers de béton et déclencher des attaques puissantes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En vez de hacer uso de la fuerza bruta, blande columnas de hormigón con la energía centrífuga de sus movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"力に 頼らず 遠心力を うまく 活かして コンクリートを 振り回す 技を 使いこなせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Le béton préparé par Bétochef est bien plus solide qu’un béton ordinaire, même si les mêmes ingrédients sont utilisés."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"El hormigón que preparan los Conkeldurr es mucho más duro y resistente que el ordinario, aunque la composición sea la misma."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Concrete mixed by Conkeldurr is much more durable than normal concrete, even when the compositions of the two materials are the same."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"同じ 成分でも ローブシンが 混ぜた コンクリートの ほうが ずっと 硬く 丈夫だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Quand il décide de passer aux choses sérieuses, il jette ses piliers de béton et saute sur son adversaire pour le frapper du poing."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando decide ponerse en serio, suelta sus pilares de hormigón y se abalanza sobre el rival con solo un puño como arma."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"When going all out, this Pokémon throws aside its concrete pillars and leaps at opponents to pummel them with its fists."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"本気に なると コンクリートの 柱を 捨て去り 拳ひとつで 相手に めがけ とびかかる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":534,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[11,"level-up",12],[14,"level-up",12],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",12],[16,"level-up",12],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"counter","learns":[[25,"egg",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name"